# Admin console (admin/). Nothing here is secret, and nothing secret belongs here: the console
# never holds tokens, passwords, or keys. Copy to .env.local only if a value must differ.
#
# Laravel behind the same-origin dev proxy (/api/v1/admin). Read by vite.config.ts at startup,
# never sent to the browser. Native default: php artisan serve on 127.0.0.1:8000. The Docker
# development service sets http://backend:8000 itself (infra/docker/compose.dev.yaml).
SOLVEIT_ADMIN_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
